% Flute repertoire of the fifers of the Black Watch, 1813 =================================

Common repertoire (first part of the books):

  1 The King's Anthem
  2 Rule Britannia
  3 The Marquis of Huntly's Snuff Mull
  4 Miss Flora Mc Donald's Reel
  5 Highland Laddie (6/8)
  6 Buonaparte's Gallop from Leipzig
  7 General Blucher's Waltz
  8 Prussian Waltz
  9 The 42nd Regiment's March
 10 Duke of York's March + Trio
 11 Duke of York's New march
 12 March in the Battle of Prague
 13 Colmans Grand March
 14 Lady Mac Donald's Reel

Personal selections:

 15 Monaghan Jig
 16 Carraig's Rant
 17 Eight Men of Moidart
 18 The Black Mull
 19 Come Under My Plaidie or Jonie McGill
 20 A Reel
 21 Greig's Pipes
 22 Money in Both Pockets
 23 The Fife Hunt
 24 Loach Earn Side Reel
 25 Lady Mary Ramsey
 26 Crop the Croppies
 27 Blackamore Jig
 28 Lady Haddo's Strathspey
 29 Mrs Baker's Hornpipe
 30 Highland Laddie (2/4)
 31 Sir David Hunter Blair's Reel
 32 Duke of Gordon's Birth Day
 33 Kiss Me Sweetly
 34 Neil Gow's Wife
 35 Staten Island
 36 Sailors Laddy
 37 St Patrick's Day in the Morning
 38 Morgiana in Ireland

